{"title":"Ember Core","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Cinderling, Magma Elemental, Molten Colossus, The Emberfang&#39;S Heart, Cinder Heart +1 more</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"magma-elemental\" title=\"Magma Elemental - dropped it in 11 of 11 looted corpses (1/1)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/ef38503655c5b6a46ca4.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Magma Elemental</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1–3</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"molten-colossus\" title=\"Molten Colossus - dropped it in 4 of 4 looted corpses (1/1)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/805b94eaaf5e2fcfe648.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Molten Colossus</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1–2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"cinder-heart\" title=\"Cinder Heart - dropped it in 1 of 1 looted corpses (1/1)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/5e0dca69c58c25f04ecb.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Cinder Heart</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"cinderling\" title=\"Cinderling - dropped it in 48 of 55 looted corpses (1/1.1)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/9f8098a31faccb169559.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Cinderling</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.1<br>×1–10</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+2 more\">+2 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"emberfang-heart\" title=\"The Emberfang&#39;S Heart - dropped it in 2 of 3 looted corpses (1/1.5)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/5e68e9d0b6af82b39346.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">The Emberfang&#39;S Heart</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.5<br>×3</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dryback\" title=\"Dryback - dropped it in 1 of 3 looted corpses (1/3)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/db15a9bfa88238ad85fe.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dryback</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×2</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"ember-core\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/f51fcc7dea071d81fbeb.svg\" alt=\"Ember Core\"></div><h3>Ember Core</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>6 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>11/6/2026, 6:07:28 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}